requires interrupted record-only creation with authoritative bootstrap recovery; no chooser, bootstrap creation or recovery flow exists. Pending implementation owner: TASK-260830-1wb06o\\nsection:14.7.5 | Section 14.7.5 defines the upstream selector publication evaluator and its source-only case inventory. Source publication does not attest runtime provenance, temporal boundaries or running AX implemen\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 17133,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 4284,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
